# Fast Task-02 synthesis-feasibility gate.  It deliberately stops before
# technology mapping and ABC, so it can expose RTL/process/memory lowering
# blockers without paying the full PPA cost.
#
# The golden closure instantiates hundreds of CHAN_BASE-parameterized
# q4_dequant_matvec_ch leaves; deriving each unique paramod in hierarchy is
# what previously consumed the whole 600s gate.  The leaf is therefore read
# as a (-lib) blackbox here: hierarchy resolves every leaf instantiation to
# an empty cell, while the measure flow still reads the real body.
read_verilog -sv -lib harness/ppa_leaves_blackbox.v
read_verilog -sv -defer @READFILES@
hierarchy -check -top TOP
proc; opt -fast; memory -nomap; opt -fast
clean
stat
